It's more about having a plan than a specific set of items.

I've ascended a few times with AC in the -30 something range though I prefer
-40. I think a good AC is the single most important thing in Nethack.

Don't allow yourself to be surrounded and attacked by several monsters at
once. Use Elbereth with a /oFire or Lightning to repel some of the monsters.
A ?oSM does about the same.  Charm/Tame Monsters. Use the insects to buffer
yourself from the dangerous monsters.

Move fast, don't fight if you can help it. If you must fight, kill things
quickly. Teleport things away. Jumping boots and an alternate source of
speed is better than speed boots if you remember to jump.

Detect the portals and go there quickly. Don't allow yourself to be
burdened.

Be prepared to rescue yourself a few times. "oLS, !oFH, a prayer. Have a
sure method to cure sickness. Have a way to uncurse items.

Zap sleep insects in doorways once you are through.

